{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Pocket Racer Shop Sim</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build. Customize. Race. Collect.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pocket Racer Shop Sim is a cozy shop simulator with a racing twist. Run your dream shop, unlock booster packs filled with parts, and build pocket-sized machines to put on the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/404d2af3ee39f2fb007a2801287c45a9.poster.avif?t=1757684692\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/404d2af3ee39f2fb007a2801287c45a9.webm?t=1757684692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/404d2af3ee39f2fb007a2801287c45a9.mp4?t=1757684692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Design Your Shop:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate, rearrange, and set the vibe of your store \u2014 from shelves to lighting to music playlists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/c1ebef4b1c7b76e625248adba6aa3bda.poster.avif?t=1757684692\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/c1ebef4b1c7b76e625248adba6aa3bda.webm?t=1757684692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/c1ebef4b1c7b76e625248adba6aa3bda.mp4?t=1757684692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Collect Parts:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open booster packs to collect a vast assortment of parts from cosmetic pieces to high performance motors.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/eb45603767d1387d82b695ea2180e990.poster.avif?t=1757684692\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/eb45603767d1387d82b695ea2180e990.webm?t=1757684692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/eb45603767d1387d82b695ea2180e990.mp4?t=1757684692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Build &amp; Race:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix motors, gears, wheels, and bodies to create your ultimate racer, then test it out on your shop\u2019s track.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/9ef58d401b6401040b0f1e6e24875704.poster.avif?t=1757684692\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/9ef58d401b6401040b0f1e6e24875704.webm?t=1757684692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/9ef58d401b6401040b0f1e6e24875704.mp4?t=1757684692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Create &amp; Share:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tracks as you progress, or build your own with the Track Designer and challenge others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/afc6642d907905d4666103cd8d1cf34e.poster.avif?t=1757684692\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/afc6642d907905d4666103cd8d1cf34e.webm?t=1757684692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/extras/afc6642d907905d4666103cd8d1cf34e.mp4?t=1757684692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends to your shop or go visit theirs where you can buy parts, check out shop designs, or join in a race.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982690?t=1757684692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982690?t=1757684692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/eb254b2fb81b9c25d1d65581e1b61386f9f4c7e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757684692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982690/eb254b2fb81b9c25d1d65581e1b61386f9f4c7e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757684692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Pocket Racer Shop Sim</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build. Customize. Race. Collect.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pocket Racer Shop Sim is a cozy shop simulator with a racing twist. Run your dream shop, unlock booster packs filled with parts, and build pocket-sized machines to put on the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_